            "description": {
              "value": "When you aid a friend with a task, you find many ways to help and avoid interfering.\n\nOn a critical success to Aid, you grant your ally a +3 circumstance bonus if you have expert proficiency in the skill (rather than +2), and you grant your ally a +4 circumstance bonus if you have master proficiency (rather than +3). If you roll a critical failure on a check to Aid, you don't give your ally a \u20131 circumstance penalty to their check."
            }
          }
